WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:01,910
While the store is not yet renovated,

2
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:03,430
Why don't you consider changing the type?

3
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:04,750
Such as milk tea shop

4
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:08,380
Monitor, you are really getting better and better at joking now.

5
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,860
No matter how good you are at serving coffee

6
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,260
Can it be compared to what is done online?

7
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,820
My shop owner sells mid- to high-end products

8
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,420
It starts at fifteen yuan a cup

9
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:17,220
No matter how it can be worse than the bottled coffee in your store that only costs a few yuan,

10
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:19,220
OK but I didn't say

11
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:20,820
Okay monitor, I have something else to do

12
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:23,140
Let's talk next time. Bring me a lighter.

13
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:31,000
What's wrong, Yuyu?

14
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:31,920
Are you hungry?

15
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:34,460
Who was that aunt just now?

16
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:36,540
Yuyu is very dissatisfied with you now

17
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:37,660
You always explain

18
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,900
Is that the stepmother you found for Yuyu?
